# hub
## The morning
:hub
?if actions_left() == 3
  The shadows are still long, and blue, and the heat has not yet begun to bite. The streets are filling with persons in their best clothes.
?elif actions_left() == 2
  It is nine, and the heat has begun. The pavements hold it. There is a drum, in the distance, somewhere in the Tremé, and a good deal of singing.
?else
  It is eleven, and the city has stopped. Every awning is down. Somewhere a bell begins, and it is a long time before you understand that it is for noon, and that it is, for once, ten minutes early.
?end
